**
# vsce applies `!` patterns after all ignore patterns: a broad `!dist/**` would also re-include
# source maps and any stale build artifact. List the five files esbuild actually produces
# (extension host, chat webview, Connect webview).
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webview.js
!dist/webview.css
!dist/connect.js
!dist/connect.css
!media/**
!package.json
!package.nls*.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
